OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy start but sunny
OL,6,Fspells soon developing. Most places
OL,7,Fwill be dry but a few showers are
OL,8,Flikely especially across Argyll and
OL,9,FArran. Mainly light winds away.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA few showers continue across
OL,12,FArgyll and Arran, but most paces will
OL,13,Fbe dry with some long clear spells
OL,14,Fdeveloping. Chilly with mainly light
OL,15,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
